.TH stool-man 1  "stool-man "
.SH NAME
stool\-man \- Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-man\fR [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
